e AI Ocean: A Survey on Hallucination in Large Language Models","page":13,"quote":"5.2.1 Mitigating hallucination introduced in pre-training during SFT The SFT process, as a critical step in aligning LLMs with human preference, can contribute to mitigating hallucinations that originate from the pre-training phase."},{"id":"c4","chunkId":"d2068edc08df316d_c_cd092cd0d7cad935","docId":"d2068edc08df316d","docTitle":"Siren's Song in the AI Ocean: A Survey on Hallucination in Large Language Models","page":11,"quote":"Problematic alignment process could mislead LLMs into hallucination LLMs typically un- dergo an alignment process following pre-training, where they receive further training on curated instruction-following examples to align their re-"},{"id":"c5","chunkId":"d2068edc08df316d_c_57bd2cab72afc7c2","docId":"d2068edc08df316d","docTitle":"Siren's Song in the AI Ocean: A Survey on Hallucination in Large Language Models","page":2,"quote":"2 Parametric Memorization Pre-training SFT RLHF Inference Overinflated Self-confidence Misleading Alignment Generation-time Risk Curating Training Data Honesty-oriented RL Decoding Strategy Knowledge Retrieve Honesty-oriented SFT"},{"id":"c6","chunkId":"d2068edc08df316d_c_619fda2390d95802","docId":"d2068edc08df316d","docTitle":"Siren's Song in the AI Ocean: A Survey on Hallucination in Large Language Models","page":2,"quote":"Transformer-based LLMs have demonstrated exceptional performance across tasks, and have therefore shifted NLP from a paradigm centered on task-specific solutions to general-purpose pre- training (Devlin et al., 2019; Radford et al., 2019)."},{"id":"c7","chunkId":"396a0fadeb4cd40f_c_589bc4e8cae01e02","docId":"396a0fadeb4cd40f","docTitle":"2312.10997_Retrieval_Augmented_Generation_for_Large_Language_Models_A_Survey","page":2,"quote":"Given ChatGPT’s reliance on pre- training data, it initially lacks the capacity to provide up- dates on recent developments."},{"id":"c8","chunkId":"14671c78fc7de99d_c_d3b32d1652b3e35d","docId":"14671c78fc7de99d","docTitle":"2405.14831_HippoRAG_Neurobiologically_Inspired_Long_Term_Memory_for_Large_Languag","page":18,"quote":"Pre-training language model incor- porating domain-specific heterogeneous knowledge into a unified representation."},{"id":"c9","chunkId":"23e3249e9a1e7541_c_74ae59804122cb69","docId":"23e3249e9a1e7541","docTitle":"2005.11401_Retrieval_Augmented_Generation_for_Knowledge_Intensive_NLP_Tasks","page":11,"quote":"BERT: Pre-training of Deep Bidirectional Transformers for Language Understanding."},{"id":"c10","chunkId":"23e3249e9a1e7541_c_9575a1b71371de3e","docId":"23e3249e9a1e7541","docTitle":"2005.11401_Retrieval_Augmented_Generation_for_Knowledge_Intensive_NLP_Tasks","page":3,"quote":"Updating the document encoder BERTd during training is costly as it requires the document index to be periodically updated as REALM does during pre-training [20]."},{"id":"c11","chunkId":"396a0fadeb4cd40f_c_edf44178ff442ebf","docId":"396a0fadeb4cd40f","docTitle":"2312.10997_Retrieval_Augmented_Generation_for_Large_Language_Models_A_Survey","page":1,"quote":"Initially, RAG’s inception coincided with the rise of the Transformer architecture, focusing on enhancing language models by incorporating additional knowledge through Pre- Training Models (PTM)."},{"id":"c12","chunkId":"23e3249e9a1e7541_c_bd284089f30f7892","docId":"23e3249e9a1e7541","docTitle":"2005.11401_Retrieval_Augmented_Generation_for_Knowledge_Intensive_NLP_Tasks","page":11,"quote":"REALM: Retrieval-augmented language model pre-training."},{"id":"c13","chunkId":"3a2ca388b4a2fb17_c_3b3ba22a4f3fce94","docId":"3a2ca388b4a2fb17","docTitle":"2304.09542_Is_ChatGPT_Good_at_Search_Investigating_Large_Language_Models_as_Re_Ra","page":10,"quote":"Pre-training methods in information retrieval."},{"id":"c14","chunkId":"14671c78fc7de99d_c_dde6285270dd3d03","docId":"14671c78fc7de99d","docTitle":"2405.14831_HippoRAG_Neurobiologically_Inspired_Long_Term_Memory_for_Large_Languag","page":17,"quote":"Deep bidirectional language-knowledge graph pretraining."},{"id":"c15","chunkId":"396a0fadeb4cd40f_c_edf44178ff442ebf","docId":"396a0fadeb4cd40f","docTitle":"2312.10997_Retrieval_Augmented_Generation_for_Large_Language_Models_A_Survey","page":1,"quote":"This early stage was characterized by foundational work aimed at refining pre-training techniques [3]–[5].The subsequent arrival of ChatGPT [6] marked a pivotal moment, with LLM demonstrating powerful in context learning (ICL) capabilities."},{"id":"c16","chunkId":"d2068edc08df316d_c_4e911b2558bb824f","docId":"d2068edc08df316d","docTitle":"Siren's Song in the AI Ocean: A Survey on Hallucination in Large Language Models","page":5,"quote":"These pre-training corpora are automatically collected from the web and often contain a significant amount of fabricated, outdated, or biased informa- tion (Penedo et al., 2023)."},{"id":"c17","chunkId":"396a0fadeb4cd40f_c_016839ec7be553a2","docId":"396a0fadeb4cd40f","docTitle":"2312.10997_Retrieval_Augmented_Generation_for_Large_Language_Models_A_Survey","page":9,"quote":"This mainly includes a sparse encoder (BM25) and a dense retriever (BERT architecture Pre-training language models)."},{"id":"c18","chunkId":"23e3249e9a1e7541_c_36c45e97d75ee2f7","docId":"23e3249e9a1e7541","docTitle":"2005.11401_Retrieval_Augmented_Generation_for_Knowledge_Intensive_NLP_Tasks","page":5,"quote":"Unlike REALM and T5+SSM, RAG enjoys strong results without expensive, specialized “salient span masking” pre-training [20]."},{"id":"c19","chunkId":"23e3249e9a1e7541_c_83d48dcc18a9d0c2","docId":"23e3249e9a1e7541","docTitle":"2005.11401_Retrieval_Augmented_Generation_for_Knowledge_Intensive_NLP_Tasks","page":10,"quote":"Palm: Pre-training an autoencod- ing&autoregressive language model for context-conditioned generation."},{"id":"c20","chunkId":"d2068edc08df316d_c_30bdbffe48567bea","docId":"d2068edc08df316d","docTitle":"Siren's Song in the AI Ocean: A Survey on Hallucination in Large Language Models","page":3,"quote":"Subsequently, we explore the source of hallucinations and discuss mitigation strategies throughout the life cycle of LLMs (pre-training→SFT→RLHF→inference)."},{"id":"c21","chunkId":"d2068edc08df316d_c_c92941154ff83193","docId":"d2068edc08df316d","docTitle":"Siren's Song in the AI Ocean: A Survey on Hallucination in Large Language Models","page":1,"quote":"Massive training data: in contrast to care- fully curating data for a specific task, LLM pre- training uses trillions of tokens obtained from the web, making it difficult to eliminate fabri- cated, outdated or bia"},{"id":"c22","chunkId":"743155d9b0541c99_c_28894cc3b8551ec2","docId":"743155d9b0541c99","docTitle":"2401.15391_MultiHop_RAG_Benchmarking_Retrieval_Augmented_Generation_for_Multi_Hop","page":10,"quote":"Text embeddings by weakly- supervised contrastive pre-training."},{"id":"c23","chunkId":"d2068edc08df316d_c_0412fa572d833094","docId":"d2068edc08df316d","docTitle":"Siren's Song in the AI Ocean: A Survey on Hallucination in Large Language Models","page":12,"quote":"isinformation in the pre-training corpus could corrupt the parametric knowledge of LLMs, which is a significant factor contributing to hallu- cinations, as previously discussed in § 4."},{"id":"c24","chunkId":"ac529ab762fd1672_c_fc13e30f668eafd2","docId":"ac529ab762fd1672","docTitle":"HybridRAG: Integrating Knowledge Graphs and Vector Retrieval Augmented Generation for Efficient Information Extraction","page":8,"quote":"Kgpt: Knowledge- grounded pre-training for data-to-text generation."},{"id":"c25","chunkId":"d2068edc08df316d_c_c95256665dcb492e","docId":"d2068edc08df316d","docTitle":"Siren's Song in the AI Ocean: A Survey on Hallucination in Large Language Models","page":12,"quote":"(2022) propose to prepend the topic pre- fix to sentences in the factual documents to make each sentence serve as a standalone fact during pre-training."},{"id":"c26","chunkId":"d2068edc08df316d_c_07a043c774a9ccea","docId":"d2068edc08df316d","docTitle":"Siren's Song in the AI Ocean: A Survey on Hallucination in Large Language Models","page":12,"quote":"For example, the pre-training data of GPT-3 (Brown et al., 2020) is cleaned by using similarity to a range of high-quality reference corpora."},{"id":"c27","chunkId":"d2068edc08df316d_c_221d712645942a57","docId":"d2068edc08df316d","docTitle":"Siren's Song in the AI Ocean: A Survey on Hallucination in Large Language Models","page":13,"quote":"During pre-training, LLMs are exposed to vast and diverse corpora, which may include inaccurate, outdated, or inconsis- tent information."},{"id":"c28","chunkId":"d2068edc08df316d_c_619fda2390d95802","docId":"d2068edc08df316d","docTitle":"Siren's Song in the AI Ocean: A Survey on Hallucination in Large Language Models","page":2,"quote":"In addition to performance improvement on downstream tasks, recent work has found that scal- ing up pretrained language models—both in terms of model parameter count and the volume of pre- training data—enables some remarkable abilities,"},{"id":"c29","chunkId":"01d82c67ac18ffc3_c_6caefdf15f202499","docId":"01d82c67ac18ffc3","docTitle":"2404.03868_Extract_Define_Canonicalize_An_LLM_based_Framework_for_Knowledge_Graph","page":9,"quote":"Knowledge graph based syn- thetic corpus generation for knowledge-enhanced language model pre-training."},{"id":"c30","chunkId":"14671c78fc7de99d_c_784801446a75a137","docId":"14671c78fc7de99d","docTitle":"2405.14831_HippoRAG_Neurobiologically_Inspired_Long_Term_Memory_for_Large_Languag","page":1,"quote":"Despite their impressive accomplishments, large language models (LLMs), even with retrieval- augmented generation (RAG), still struggle to efficiently and effectively integrate a large amount of new experiences after pre-training."},{"id":"c31","chunkId":"23e3249e9a1e7541_c_d125f8e7fcbac0e3","docId":"23e3249e9a1e7541","docTitle":"2005.11401_Retrieval_Augmented_Generation_for_Knowledge_Intensive_NLP_Tasks","page":2,"quote":"Our RAG models achieve state-of-the-art results 